        "@value": "Lobby Exhibition: Pretty, Not Pretty"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The fine-art photography exhibition &quot;Pretty NOT Pretty&quot; showcases the innovative works of artists Judy H McPhee and Anette Schrage, who each explore their unique interpretations of beauty. Through their lenses, they capture a diverse array of subjects, ranging from mundane everyday items to overlooked discarded objects, inviting viewers to reconsider conventional notions of beauty. This [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
