        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Come kick off Winter Break with GISS Music! Featuring original songs and compositions from the Composition and Production Class and GISPA Music Students, as well as performances from the Choir, Concert Band, Jazz Band and Jazz Combo. Please note - both nights are different nights of music, so to catch all the action you must [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
